		{ "4.0.0",
			"|cffffd100No price addon needed:|r Craft Profit can now scan the auction house for prices itself. With neither TSM nor Auctionator installed, the scan starts by itself when you open the auction house, at most once an hour, and chat says when it starts and when it's done. With TSM or Auctionator, their prices still come first, and a scan you start yourself fills in items they have no price for. Start one with |cffffd100Scan now|r on the new Prices tab or |cffffd100/craftprofit scan|r. New options: |cffffd100Scan when I open the auction house|r, and |cffffd100Craft Profit's scan only|r under |cffffd100Price addon|r.",
			"|cffffd100Auction house window:|r Craft Profit's own window opens beside the game's auction house window, with four tabs: |cffffd100Shopping list|r, |cffffd100Sell|r, |cffffd100My auctions|r and |cffffd100Prices|r. A button with Craft Profit's logo on the side of the auction house window opens and closes it. It opens by itself when your Craft Profit shopping list has something on it, or when Auctionator isn't installed; turn that off with |cffffd100Open at the auction house|r in the options.",
			"|cffffd100Craft Profit's own shopping list:|r a third choice under |cffffd100Shop with|r, and where the Shopping list button adds materials when Auctionator isn't installed. The Shopping list tab shows what you still have to buy and what it costs. Click a material to show it at the auction house with the amount to buy, right-click to take it off. Materials come off the list as you get them. Away from the auction house, open it from the minimap button's menu or with |cffffd100/craftprofit shop|r.",
			"|cffffd100Sell tab:|r everything in your bags that can be auctioned: your favorites, your own crafts, then the rest by kind of item. Pick an item and the price starts at the lowest listing (it's left empty when a vendor pays more than that) and the amount at all you have. |cffffd100Post|r puts the auction up and moves on to the next item. The game's own sell page is filled in with the same auction, and a price, amount or duration you change there changes in the tab too. Search the list by name, right-click an item to make it a favorite or hide it, click a section's name to fold it away, and drag it to change the order. |cffffd100Default posting time|r in the options sets how long auctions last.",
